  <Client>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c710770abf287dc46b346fe2f2467822, type: 2}
  <TextContent>k__BackingField: 'Kitten,

    I know you must be quite busy, but
    I need your help for something.

    I miss home. Usually I go on walks in the
    forest as it makes me feel more at home. But alas, you know, my legs aren''t
    what they used to be, which is why I''d like you to prepare a Forest Scent for
    me.

    Happy brewing,'
  <LetterType>k__BackingField: 0
